{"id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-weak-systems.md","title":"The Book’s Systems Q0, Q, R0, and R","display":"df-smullyan-weak-systems — The Book’s Systems Q0, Q, R0, and R","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-weak-systems"],"display":"df-smullyan-weak-systems — The Book’s Systems Q0, Q, R0, and R","source":"第 V 章 pp. 68–69（PDF 85–86）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]","[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-weak-systems</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-weak-systems — The Book’s Systems Q0, Q, R0, and R"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 68–69（PDF 85–86）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"920841c1841d30c3\" href=\"?note=920841c1841d30c3\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems\">92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd6b982556489ede\" href=\"?note=bd6b982556489ede\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution\">92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},N_1,\\ldots,N_9,\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},N_1,\\ldots,N_9,\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"920841c1841d30c3\" href=\"?note=920841c1841d30c3\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems\">92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems</a>；全部公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\)</span> 中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E,v_1=v_1^E\">\\(\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E,v_1=v_1^E\\)</span>；派生联结词展开为原书字符串；有限析取按递增指标左结合，单项析取就是该项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_1,\\ldots,\\Omega_5,\\mathrm{Ax}_{Q_0},\\mathrm{Ax}_Q,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R_0},\\mathrm{Ax}_R,Q_{0,A},Q_A,R_{0,A},R_A\">\\(\\Omega_1,\\ldots,\\Omega_5,\\mathrm{Ax}_{Q_0},\\mathrm{Ax}_Q,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R_0},\\mathrm{Ax}_R,Q_{0,A},Q_A,R_{0,A},R_A\\)</span> 是下列定义目标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}systems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\nu_m+\\nu_n)=\\nu_{m+n}:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\nu_m\\cdot\\nu_n)=\\nu_{mn}:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_3&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg_E(\\nu_m=\\nu_n):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\ne n\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_4&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\leftrightarrow_E\\bigvee_{i=0}^{n}(v_1=\\nu_i):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_5&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\lor_E(\\nu_n\\leq v_1):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{Q_0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_8\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_9\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{R_0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^{4}\\Omega_i,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_R&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^{5}\\Omega_i,\\\\\nU_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_U,\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A})\n\\quad(U\\in\\{Q_0,Q,R_0,R\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}systems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\nu_m+\\nu_n)=\\nu_{m+n}:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\nu_m\\cdot\\nu_n)=\\nu_{mn}:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_3&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg_E(\\nu_m=\\nu_n):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\ne n\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_4&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\leftrightarrow_E\\bigvee_{i=0}^{n}(v_1=\\nu_i):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_5&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\lor_E(\\nu_n\\leq v_1):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{Q_0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_8\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_9\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{R_0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^{4}\\Omega_i,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_R&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^{5}\\Omega_i,\\\\\nU_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_U,\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A})\n\\quad(U\\in\\{Q_0,Q,R_0,R\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最后一行分别定义四个系统，所有数码均为尾 accent 数码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_1,\\Omega_2\">\\(\\Omega_1,\\Omega_2\\)</span> 的指标加、乘发生在元语言；相应公理里的加、乘仍是对象语言符号。Q₀、Q 没有任何归纳实例；R₀、R 有无限多个算术公理，但其给定公理集可有效检查。</p>\n<p>这里保留原书的开放公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_4,\\Omega_5\">\\(\\Omega_4,\\Omega_5\\)</span>；它们的全称闭包通过 Gen 导出。原书九条公理 Q 不能与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> 的本地七公理集合逐字等同。也不能直接代入限定于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> 的系统性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems","status":"resolved","id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"bd6b982556489ede","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems","status":"resolved","id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},N_1,\\ldots,N_9,\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]；全部公式在 $\\mathrm{Fml}_A$ 中。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里保留原书的开放公式 $\\Omega_4,\\Omega_5$；它们的全称闭包通过 Gen 导出。原书九条公理 Q 不能与 [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]] 的本地七公理集合逐字等同。也不能直接代入限定于 $\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ 的系统性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},N_1,\\ldots,N_9,\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E,v_1=v_1^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_1,\\ldots,\\Omega_5,\\mathrm{Ax}_{Q_0},\\mathrm{Ax}_Q,\\mathrm{Ax}_{R_0},\\mathrm{Ax}_R,Q_{0,A},Q_A,R_{0,A},R_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}weak\\text{-}systems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Omega_1&\\coloneqq\\{(\\nu_m+\\nu_n)=\\nu_{m+n}:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_2&\\coloneqq\\{(\\nu_m\\cdot\\nu_n)=\\nu_{mn}:m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_3&\\coloneqq\\{\\neg_E(\\nu_m=\\nu_n):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\ne n\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_4&\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\leftrightarrow_E\\bigvee_{i=0}^{n}(v_1=\\nu_i):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\Omega_5&\\coloneqq\\{(v_1\\leq\\nu_n)\\lor_E(\\nu_n\\leq v_1):n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{Q_0}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_8\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_Q&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_9\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{R_0}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^{4}\\Omega_i,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_R&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^{5}\\Omega_i,\\\\\nU_A&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_U,\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A})\n\\quad(U\\in\\{Q_0,Q,R_0,R\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega_1,\\Omega_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_4,\\Omega_5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false}],"bytes":2441,"backlinks":[{"id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地性质对应原书 Ω₄/Ω₅ 的逻辑用途；原书真实公理集见 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]。R₀ 只有 Ω₄，不满足这里列出的全部比较契约；其 Σ₀ 完备性仍由 [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]] 单独证明。"},{"id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书的九公理 Q 及八公理 Q₀ 已独立写为 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]；在原书中 R₀→Q₀ 的 subsystem 关系是定理包含，由 [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] 的逐数码有限证明支撑，不是无限公理集的字面包含。"},{"id":"ea47eabc51d9439c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Q₀/Q/R₀/R 的公理三元组现已见 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]，Σ₀ 完备性与定理集包含分别见 [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems]]。本文 IΔ₀/IΣ₁ 分类继续作为本地补充，不将其归因为原书。"},{"id":"9548f0941b8c15ce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q_{0,A}$ 是 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]] 的八公理系统，$\\nu_n=\\nu_n^E$。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书弱系统：[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-subsystems]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-weak-sigma1-completeness]]。[[92-thm-smullyan-r-prime-equivalence]]完成练习8，说明比较模式 Ω₅ 的实际用途。"},{"id":"cb46b7dc65d1aa55","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega_i,R_A$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]；所有连接词都按原书展开。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]"}],"outgoing":["920841c1841d30c3","bd6b982556489ede","468d35690d25ee42"]}